error[E0476]: a generator cannot suspend while a deferred call is pending
 --> $DIR/generator-yield-defer.nra:5:5
  |
4 |     defer cleanup();
  |     ---------------- this call runs when its block is left, after the 'yield'
5 |     yield 1;
